    "text": "If the total energy transferred to a surface in time <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math>, then the magnitude of the total momentum delivered to this surface for complete absorption will be :",
